Actually wait - I think I found it! Look at `ptls_asn1_read_length`:

```c
if (byte_index + length_of_length >= bytes_max) {
    /* This is an error */
    byte_index = ptls_asn1_error_message("Incorrect length coding", bytes_max, byte_index, level, log_ctx);
