}
```

So it returns the `byte_index` that was passed in. In the type reading error case, `byte_index` is `bytes_max` (since the while loop ran until `byte_index >= bytes_max`). No wait, the while loop also has `long_type <= type_number_limit`. If `long_type > type_number_limit`, the loop exits with `byte_index < bytes_max` potentially.

